  "content": "\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Z0eZFcG.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"2047\" height=\"719\"></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>注意：</strong></span> <br>&gt; 本模组需要&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/curios\" rel=\"nofollow\">CuriosAPI</a> 才能运行！<br>&gt; 自 1.19.2 版本起，本模组还需 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/octo-lib\" rel=\"nofollow\">OctoLib</a> 才能运行！</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><strong>遗物（Relics）</strong>是一款易于安装的拖放式模组，引入了数十种拥有复杂且设计精良机制的独特物品。每个遗物在使用时，无论是单独使用还是与其他遗物甚至其他模组搭配，都能解锁其真正的潜力。我们在设计时充分考虑到玩家的整合包不会仅包含我们的模组，因此平衡性会自动调整以适应你整合包的需求。这使得<strong>遗物</strong>完美契合原版风格整合包，也适合那些生命值和伤害数值动辄上千的硬核整合包。</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/YEVe5Z0.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"2442\" height=\"1404\"></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>《我的世界》并非无限；最终，所有游戏内容都会被消耗殆尽，玩家需要寻找属于自己的乐趣。我们在设计<strong>遗物</strong>时牢记这一点，旨在让游戏体验尽可能长久有趣。借助我们的升级系统与随机属性，没有任何两个遗物会感觉完全相同。玩家可以自由定制遗物以满足个人偏好，从而创造出近乎无限数量的独特遗物组合。</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/5luL6iu.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"2406\" height=\"1398\"></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>安装本模组你将获得：</strong></span></div>\n<div>\n<ul>\n<li>&nbsp;25 种拥有独特且复杂机制的遗物</li>\n<li>类似大型多人在线游戏的随机属性系统</li>\n<li>遗物的强化与自定义功能</li>\n<li>成长型主动技能系统</li>\n<li>……更多内容！</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/hBYMOGV.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"2388\" height=\"1386\"></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/5VVBgHs.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"473\" height=\"100\"></div>\n<div>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong>1.21.1:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/relics-mod/files/all?page=1&pageSize=20&version=1.21.1&gameVersionTypeId=6\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">NeoForge</a></strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong>1.20.1: <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/relics-mod/files/all?page=1&pageSize=20&version=1.20.1&gameVersionTypeId=1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge</a></strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong>1.19.2: <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/relics-mod/files/all?page=1&pageSize=20&version=1.19.2&gameVersionTypeId=1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge</a></strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong>1.18.2: <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/relics-mod/files/all?page=1&pageSize=20&version=1.18.2&gameVersionTypeId=1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge</a></strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong>1.16.5: <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/relics-mod/files/all?page=1&pageSize=20&version=1.16.5&gameVersionTypeId=1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge</a></strong></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/bhbk4aM.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"353\" height=\"100\"></div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ram-compat\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/935/648/638412693854768134.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/rac-compat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/1039/478/638565010537644965.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/rar-compat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/1083/26/638623617290403030.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/reliquified-ars-nouveau\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/1174/478/638746479887868344.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/reliquified-twilight-forest\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/1173/396/638745218780605206.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></a></div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/6Q6ir9f.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"193\" height=\"100\"></p>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>\n<p><strong>问：是否有移植到 Fabric/Quilt 的计划？</strong><br>答：目前暂无移植计划。不过，如果<strong>遗物</strong>进入“开发完成阶段”——且我在此期间没有失去兴趣的话——未来是有可能移植的。</p>\n<p><strong>问：是否会移植到其他 Minecraft 版本？</strong><br>答：每次移植到新版本的 Minecraft 都会伴随<strong>遗物</strong>的重大更新，因为这通常需要对模组核心进行根本性改动。我会在当前更新的所有内容公开发布后，才开始着手新版本移植。至于旧版本，将不再进行回溯移植。</p>\n<p><strong>问：能否添加指南书或类似内容？</strong><br>答：我不太喜欢指南书，所以未作规划。不过，你可以自行在整合包中添加，或者创建公开的 Wiki。</p>\n<p><strong>问：新版 Minecraft 中遗物的内容会移植回旧版吗？</strong><br>答：不会。新内容仅会添加到<strong>遗物</strong>所支持的最新 Minecraft 版本中。旧版本仅会接收漏洞修复。</p>\n<p><strong>问：我可以为遗物制作扩展模组（Addon）吗？</strong><br>答：可以，但目前我并不推荐。<strong>遗物</strong>的 API 仍不稳定且频繁变更。最好等待系统稳定后再进行开发。</p>\n<p><strong>问：我可以创建该模组的公共分支或怀旧版本吗？</strong><br>答：不可以。但如果你是为了<strong>私人</strong>用途（例如和朋友游玩且不发布至 CurseForge 等平台），那是允许的。</p>\n<p><strong>问：我可以在整合包中使用你的模组吗？</strong><br>答：可以，欢迎加入。</p>\n<p><strong>问：我可以将你的模组重新上传到其他网站吗？</strong><br>答：不可以。</p>\n</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>还有其他问题？- <a href=\"https://discord.gg/pHren9yxzW\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>访问我们的 Discord！</strong></a></div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><hr><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/AXrPQTM.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\"></div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><hr></div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/pHren9yxzW\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/gG6f4t0.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"136\" height=\"136\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/SSKirillSS/relics\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sK6KJcQ.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"136\" height=\"136\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/SSKirillSS/relics/wiki\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/z8xJ8CW.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"136\" height=\"136\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252frelics-mod\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/OYN08d0.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"136\" height=\"136\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.paypal.com%252fcgi-bin%252fwebscr%253freturn%253dhttps%253a%252f%252fwww.curseforge.com%252fminecraft%252fmc-mods%252frelics-mod%2526cn%253dAdd%2bspecial%2binstructions%2bto%2bthe%2baddon%2bauthor()%2526business%253dp%2540foxy.cat%2526bn%253dPP-DonationsBF%253abtn_donateCC_LG.gif%253aNonHosted%2526cancel_return%253dhttps%253a%252f%252fwww.curseforge.com%252fminecraft%252fmc-mods%252frelics-mod%2526lc%253dUS%2526item_name%253dRelics%2b(from%2bwww.curseforge.com)%2526cmd%253d_donations%2526rm%253d1%2526no_shipping%253d1%2526currency_code%253dUSD\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/fPIlVls.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"136\" height=\"136\"></a></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>想体验我们的其他模组？- 请访问 <span style=\"color:#b96ad9\"><a style=\"color:#b96ad9\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252focto-studios.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">OCTO-STUDIOS.COM</a></span> 了解更多详情！</strong></p>\n</div>",
